I would like to process .cwa files on a computing cluster using the OS, and R/RStudio versions specified in bold (see: GGIR_Failed_Successful_specs.pdf). Here you can find 10 .csv files from GT9X Link devices (I am not at liberty to share .cwa files due to a data sharing agreement), along with relevant outputs produced by the GGIR before the error occurred, and two screenshots of an error (also attached): https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uJl9Pc0Tjx6-97z51uZukOJ2pPLSaVzX/view?usp=sharing

