Hi,

Thanks for the testing data. It seems like GGIR skips the last window when recording starts at midnight and timewindow = "MM". I have described the issue here <https://github.com/wadpac/GGIR/issues/852> and I plan to work on a solution in the following days.

Best,
Jairo

